        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CTO150SLVMHGSBR, Wooden Door Pull in Mahogany</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Mahogany Wood Door Handle is made by First Impressions and is part of the <a href=\"/collections/wood-door-pulls\"><b>Wooden Door Pull Collection</b></a>. It features a rich, almost red looking wood with solid brass brackets and end-caps. The brackets and end caps are available in a wide array of finishes including polished and satin brass as well as satin chrome and oil rubbed bronze. This Mahogany Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths and can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-10SW-Mahogany-detail.jpg?v=1704354648\" width=\"580\" height=\"220\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions 10SW-Mahogany Mahogany Wood Door Handle Detailed Picture\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CTO150SLVMHGSBR Corteo Mahogany Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Mahogany</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CTO150SLVSBR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262230\"><b>First Impressions CTO150SLVMHGSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CTO150S018LVMHGSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CTO150024SLVMHGSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CTO150036SLVMHGSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
